## 4. A lesson nobody can find is not published

`web-foundations/docs/_data/lessons.yml` is the registry that drives the `/lessons/{lang}/` browser and `head-hreflang.html`. **Twelve FE II units existed as live URLs but were invisible** because nobody registered them.

**Rule:** every new lesson gets an entry. Match the existing shape exactly:

```yaml
- slug: feii-unit-5-testing-strategy
  title:
   en: 'Unit 5: Testing Strategy — Designing a Suite That Earns Its Cost'
  path:
   en: /lessons/en/feii/unit-5-testing-strategy/
  file:
   en: lessons/en/feii/unit-5-testing-strategy/index.md
  status:
   en: draft
  category: feii
  tags: [feii, testing, ci-cd]
```

- `slug` must be **globally unique** across the file.
- Only declare an `es:`/`en:` key if that file **actually exists** — the site currently has 11 broken links from registered-but-never-written translations.
- Tracks use the same file with `type: track`.
- A multi-unit sequence also needs its own **index page** (`/lessons/en/feii/`), mirroring `/lessons/en/react/`.

