## 5. Frontmatter and TOC boilerplate

Every lesson opens with exactly this, and the fence is **load-bearing** — a typo (`pretier-ignore-end` shipped in two units) leaves the marker visible and unprotects the TOC:

```markdown
<!-- prettier-ignore-start -->

## 📋 Table of Contents
{: .no_toc }
- TOC
{:toc}

<!-- prettier-ignore-end -->
```

Required frontmatter: `layout: lesson`, `title`, `slug`, `date`, `author`, `lang`, `permalink` (trailing slash), `status`, `tags`. Use `category` for units in a sequence. Pages live as `<slug>/index.md`, never bare `<slug>.md`.

